{"parse": {"title": "衣着/寰宇行舟", "pageid": 136028, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"character-skin-page\"><div class=\"character-base-info\"><div class=\"character-img-box0 tabber\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px\"><div class=\"character-img-box1\"><div class=\"tabber-item hide-m\" data-isl2d=\"1\" data-tabberimg=\"Skin_bg-310103.webp\" data-tabberimgclass=\"img-fit-height\" style=\"position:absolute; right:0; height:100%;display:none;\"></div><div class=\"character-img-box2\"><img alt=\"Zhujiemian you di.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bc/Zhujiemian_you_di.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"508\" height=\"612\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" data-file-width=\"508\" data-file-height=\"612\" /></div><div class=\"character-img-box2 tabber-item\" data-id=\"310103\" data-isl2d=\"0\" data-tabberimg=\"Portrait-310103.webp\" data-tabberimgclass=\"img-fit\" data-tabberimglink=\"File:Portrait-310103.webp\"></div><div class=\"character-img-box2 tabber-item\" data-isl2d=\"1\" data-tabberimg=\"L2d_static-310103_blm_p.webp\" data-tabberimgclass=\"img-fit\" data-tabberimglink=\"File:L2d_static-310103_blm_p.webp\" style=\"display:none;\"></div></div><div class=\"character-desc-offset\"><div class=\"character-img-button-group\"><div class=\"tabber-filter l2d-button-group\"><div class=\"l2d-button\"><img alt=\"Btm lihui.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/4/4d/Btm_lihui.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"84\" height=\"84\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"84\" data-file-height=\"84\" /></div><div class=\"tabber-item\" data-isl2d=\"0\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-isl2d=\"1\" data-type=\"isl2d\">L2D</div></div><div class=\"tabber-item\" data-isl2d=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item selected\" data-isl2d=\"0\" data-type=\"isl2d\">立绘</div></div></div></div><div class=\"img-desc img-desc-only\" style=\"position:relative; padding-bottom:25px\">她的尾焰将要比肩流星。</div><div class=\"character-spine\"><div class=\"no-select\" style=\"position:absolute; bottom:-10px\"><img alt=\"Pifuxiaorendi 008.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/ae/Pifuxiaorendi_008.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"240\" height=\"224\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"240\" data-file-height=\"224\" /></div><div><img alt=\"Spine static-310103 blm.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/7/7f/Spine_static-310103_blm.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"387\" height=\"415\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"387\" data-file-height=\"415\" /></div></div></div></div><div class=\"character-infobox\" style=\"display:block\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:20px\"><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新形象</div></div><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新单品</div></div></div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">可用角色：</span><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3101\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%99%BD%E6%9C%97%E5%A7%86\" title=\"白朗姆\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%99%BD%E6%9C%97%E5%A7%86\" title=\"白朗姆\"><img alt=\"白朗姆\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-310101.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-310101.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-310101.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"133\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%99%BD%E6%9C%97%E5%A7%86\" title=\"白朗姆\">白朗姆</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>3.6</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>活动</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>新世界的风</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：310103</div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">金属闪烁着冰冷的银光，昂扬地指向天空。高大的港口建筑里，改造后的瓶中船兴奋地等待着发射时刻。<br />这是最理想的年代：所有人都怀揣着对宇宙与星空的浪漫想象。在遥远的数光年外，在尾宿八、在金牛座、在十字架二，是怎样的光景？是否存在我们的伙伴？而这位意识唤醒者，将会成为第一个见证未知的幸运儿！<br />建筑轰鸣，大地震动，灰白的烟雾弥漫，鲜红的火花构成航船拖曳的尾巴。<br />出发——这一次的目的地是，未来！</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"310103\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-310104.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/d4/Belonging-310104.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">新征程座舱<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"New Journey\" Cabin</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />18.5<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>由罗伯特·波义耳的烧瓶材料重铸而成的“太空座舱”，拥有风阻更小的新形状，以及全新的推进系统。<br />受访者对自己不能在起飞后自由出入瓶子略感遗憾，但拉普拉斯的研究员承诺，等找到外星球的液态海洋时，这一问题将迎刃而解。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-310105.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/4/46/Belonging-310105.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">光能轻帆<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Solar Sail</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />2<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>太阳能原理的轻型帆布，受限于帆布面积与技术水平，象征意义大于实际意义。<br />受访者非常高兴，负责改装设计的研究员尊重了“属于帆船的传统”。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-310106.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/8/81/Belonging-310106.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“她的远望”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Her Ambition\"</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>昔日的保护者，亦将见证今日向天空而去的远航。<br />“老安妮，想想看，星空上到处都是未经探索的处女地！”受访者踌躇满志，她已经找到了一艘海盗船的新目标。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AF%B0%E5%AE%87%E8%A1%8C%E8%88%9F1.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 寰宇行舟1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AF%B0%E5%AE%87%E8%A1%8C%E8%88%9F1.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AF%B0%E5%AE%87%E8%A1%8C%E8%88%9F1.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AF%B0%E5%AE%87%E8%A1%8C%E8%88%9F1.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AF%B0%E5%AE%87%E8%A1%8C%E8%88%9F1.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AF%B0%E5%AE%87%E8%A1%8C%E8%88%9F1.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AF%B0%E5%AE%87%E8%A1%8C%E8%88%9F1.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AF%B0%E5%AE%87%E8%A1%8C%E8%88%9F2.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 寰宇行舟2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AF%B0%E5%AE%87%E8%A1%8C%E8%88%9F2.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AF%B0%E5%AE%87%E8%A1%8C%E8%88%9F2.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AF%B0%E5%AE%87%E8%A1%8C%E8%88%9F2.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AF%B0%E5%AE%87%E8%A1%8C%E8%88%9F2.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AF%B0%E5%AE%87%E8%A1%8C%E8%88%9F2.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AF%B0%E5%AE%87%E8%A1%8C%E8%88%9F2.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">寰宇行舟 <small style=\"color: grey\">Sailing Around the World</small></span></span>"}}